carrier_floor_rules_excerpt.md -- VERBATIM excerpt of the working-tree carrier GXEMUL-SEC/tools/CLAUDE.md, which is byte-identical
to the project-root CLAUDE.md (md5 e2c9b6ab43e0c9ba167eed606527d1ea, 4089 lines).  Every line carries its ORIGINAL line number as `CLAUDE.md:<n>`;
cite those numbers.  The working tree carries rule D2 ('AND A REGION IS PINNED AT ITS EDGE'), adopted by owner ruling
2026-10-09 and NOT yet committed -- the committed HEAD copy of tools/CLAUDE.md lacks it.  Spans:

  CLAUDE.md:1306-1794  the vacuity floor: clauses (a)-(d), the DEPENDS-ON bound, JOINT CELLS, the label clauses, the pass-11 floor, the generating set, TESTS, rule D2 (region pinned at its edge), derived inputs, the PRE-TABLE CHECK and CHANNEL line, clause (e)
  CLAUDE.md:2373-2386  coverage debt above the floor
  CLAUDE.md:2448-2484  the ask-again and its cap
