1303: 				    MEASURED: SIGSEGV at address 0x48, which is
1304: 				    offsetof(struct scsi_transfer, data_in_len).  The pre-#475 blob
1305: 				    survives the identical input, and the row for the defect #475 FIXED
1306: 				    goes the OTHER way on the same pair -- so the bisect is unambiguous.
1307: 
1308: 				    The clamp was right; the branch it woke was never NULL-safe.  Decline
1309: 				    and say so once, per this file's latch idiom: a device that cannot
1310: 				    service an access must not take the emulator with it (#337, #184,
1311: 				    #186, #315, #316, #326).  */
