1319: 				    d->atapi_phase != PHASE_CMDOUT) {
1320: 					/*  #477: A STRAY DATA-PORT READ MUST NOT REWRITE THE PHASE WHILE A
1321: 					    CDB IS BEING COLLECTED.  Measured by the Fable seat as a
1322: 					    REGRESSION of the dispatch phase guard below: HEAD services
1323: 					    `PKT, stray read, CDB` after a prior completed command, and
1324: 					    without this arm's phase test the CDB never dispatches at all.
1325: 
1326: 					    The ATAPI_PKT_CMD arm of wdc_command() assigns only the flag and
1327: 					    the phase, so a new packet starts with atapi_len == 0,
1328: 					    atapi_received == data_in_len and atapi_st STALE NON-NULL (it is
