1331: 					    PHASE_COMPLETED -- moving the phase off CMDOUT before the CDB is
1332: 					    complete.
1333: 
1334: 					    *** AND THE RESIDUE THAT MAKES IT UNRECOVERABLE IS A PROPERTY OF
1335: 					    THE DEVICE, NOT OF THIS REGRESSION -- an earlier draft of this
1336: 					    comment said otherwise, and the Opus seat MEASURED the
1337: 					    difference. ***
1338: 
1339: 					    *** THE NEXT SENTENCE WAS TRUE WHEN WRITTEN AND IS FALSE AT
1340: 					    HEAD.  Corrected 2026-08-30. ***  It read: `ATAPI_PKT_CMD
1341: 					    never flushes the ring, and neither reset path does either,
1342: 					    so an under-drained DATA-IN leaves occupancy at 32 -> 44 ->
1343: 					    56 -> 68 and every later CDB is dropped forever.  That
1344: 					    entrance is open`.  It is not open: wdc_new_command_reset()
