166: **R3. Widths sentence, `REPAIR3.c.txt:1150-1153`.** "widths 2 and 4 are read by every walk" is false (`codex_r3pass_records.txt:1`, `:15-17`). The six walks are four `write_route_case` calls at widths 2, 4, 2, 1 (`REPAIR3.c.txt:7238-7243`), `rows_walk_32769` at width 2 (`REPAIR3.c.txt:6549`), and `row_second_transfer` at width 2 (fable `fable5_r3pass.md:106`). Replace:
