74: ## Q2 -- THE 36 SURVIVORS, class by class
75: 
76: **EQUIVALENT -- AGREE, each verified against the product (READ):**
77: - re-arm/arm `>= 32768`, `> 32767`, `32768L` (fb_Eh, o1_h, p2_K2, o1_rc_gt32767, o1_ac_ge, o1_ac_gt32767, V7a, V7b): at 32768 both forms assign 32768.
