88: **EQUIVALENT BY REACHABILITY -- AGREE:** n_E_dphase_le admits DATAOUT (0x08), COMPLETED (0x03) and 0; every entry into COMPLETED/DATAOUT leaves the ring empty (the dispatch has just popped exactly 12; the completion fires when `atapi_len` reaches 0 and ring occupancy tracks `atapi_len` during DATAIN because pops equal `consumed` -- widths 1..8 pop 1,2,2,4,2,2,2,2 and count the same -- and #495 refuses guest pushes there), and in those phases #495 keeps it empty; occupancy 12 cannot arise.  The guest path that would reach it is DATAOUT implemented, as the contract says.
