126: NOT CHECKABLE from the packet: nothing that bears on the verdict.  The one thing I could not settle by reading is whether REPAIR4's PIO row would need the TEST UNIT READY form (fresh `scsi_transfer_alloc`, data_in NULL) or the abandoned-transfer form to kill the mutant most legibly -- both kill it; the first is one line.
